%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: a gray image after a CMYK colour. The five-operand `image`
% records DeviceGray samples, one component each, whatever the current
% colour space (PLRM3 section 4.10.5); only the dictionary form takes
% the current space.
0 0 0 1 setcmykcolor
100 100 translate
50 50 scale
2 2 8 [2 0 0 -2 0 2] <0055AAFF> image
showpage
